{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-01T10:55:55.720Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"489489c9e2938b0738fed20a","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1647","lineage:pm-gh1647","lineage:pm-dj98","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"pm-gh1647","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1647","lineage:pm-gh1647","lineage:pm-dj98","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.316","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-01T10:55:55.720Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Implementation: new src/core/lock/lock-confinement.ts. inspectConfinedLockDirectory lstat-walks every component between the tracker root and the lock's parent and refuses lock_path_unsafe (exit 4) on a symlink or non-directory BEFORE mkdir or the stale-cleanup gate can follow it; it runs again after the gate, and verifyConfinedLockCreation compares handle.stat() dev/ino with lstat(lockPath) plus the re-inspected directory identity, so a swap during acquisition refuses with lock_directory_replaced instead of returning a lease that excludes no one. On Linux the stray lock is located via /proc/self/fd/<fd> and removed only when its identity matches; other platforms report stray_lock_removed=false. A symlinked lock entry now refuses (lock_entry_symlink) instead of being waited on as a peer's lock, and runLockGc refuses to sweep through a symlinked locks dir (it would delete files outside the tracker). Design note: Node has no openat, so descriptor-relative creation is approximated by identity verification; the residual is a stray cleanup-gate directory inside the swapped-away real directory, which dead-owner recovery retires. Tests: 16 cases in tests/unit/core/lock/lock-confinement.spec.ts; tests/unit/core/lock + core/item lock specs + integration/locking all pass (166)."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-01T10:55:55.720Z"}],"before_hash":"ac456872474d17bc4aa637ff4e7282e1db8ab423cc4899bf025b27fa0341c319","after_hash":"8a366c9e6a8f38ad45c5c424ff65aaf576073bcd622af262712ff2dbe153d566","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"fd9da0e5e470e39cd70b058f220570f88c925797e67a6491f440a1daa5cf2066"}
